        "original_id": "3f440f37-68a2-5899-98aa-1d3ea1b0b91b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chantal Claret Euringer, Max Green, Brent Ashley, Pedro Yanowitz\n- Organizations: Morningwood, Escape the Fate, The Natural Born Killers, Combichrist\n- Roles: singer/songwriter, musician, bassist, backing vocalist, rhythm guitarist, vocalist, founder\n\nFacts:\n- Chantal Claret Euringer was born on February 21, 1982, and she is an American singer/songwriter known as Chantal Claret.\n- Max Green was born on December 15, 1984, and he is an American musician better known as Max Green.\n- Morningwood was founded in 2001, and it primarily consisted of Pedro Yanowitz and Chantal Claret.\n- Max Green was one of the founders of Escape the Fate and served as its bassist and backing vocalist.\n- Max Green was formerly the rhythm guitarist and vocalist for The Natural Born Killers.\n- Brent Ashley is a bassist who is the current bassist for Combichrist.\n- Brent Ashley was formerly the bassist for The Natural Born Killers featuring Max Green of Escape The Fate.",
